Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.03,0:20:11.65,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Tcharam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:12.04,Sign_Comic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H4E5752&\3c&H90A09E&\shad0\pos(198,54.34)\frx30\fry0\frz25.8}Matsuki Mitsuru / Hikaru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:12.16,Sign_Comic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H4E5752&\3c&H90A09E&\shad0\frx30\fry0\frz25.8\pos(322,168.34)}Matsuki Mitsuru / Hikaru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.29,Sign_Comic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H4E5752&\3c&H90A09E&\shad0\frx30\fry0\frz25.8\pos(372,219.67)}Matsuki Mitsuru / Hikaru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:14.90,Sign_Comic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H4E5752&\3c&H90A09E&\shad0\frx30\fry0\frz25.8\move(379.33,221.01,446,279.68,6,590)}Matsuki Mitsuru / Hikaru
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.46,0:20:16.45,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Uau, está todo amassado… detonado…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:22.49,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Acabei desenhando sem te consultar,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:26.15,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Koshiba, mas como está bonitinho,\Nvocê me perdoa, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:28.70,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Em janeiro,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:33.25,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,depois do velório da minha irmã, fui visitar\Naquela praia, depois de muitos anos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:39.06,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Fui na moto de uma pessoa esquisita,\Ndurante a madrugada, no meio do inverno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.80,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Estava frio pra caramba,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:45.28,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,no entanto, sentia que o vento\Nestava agradável, foi intrigante.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:50.94,Sign_Comic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad0\c&H505C92&\3c&H2A2D3C&\frz341.6\pos(360,265.33)}Diário de Desenhos
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:50.58,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ei, eu sou mais gracinha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:58.50,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,E então,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:02.78,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,eu acabei me afogando no mar, de novo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:29.53,Default,CRED,0,0,0,,- Legendas brasileiras -\NTradução: Thais Arissa Nakamura
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:33.53,Default,CRED,0,0,0,,Edição: Priscila Portela
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:37.53,Default,CRED,0,0,0,,Temporização e revisão:\NHellia Nakatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:41.53,Default,CRED,0,0,0,,Produção: Gustavo Hoffmann
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:48.05,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Vou fazer uma pausa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:54.08,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Aff, que coisa…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.43,0:22:56.40,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Isso é…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:58.96,Sign_Arial,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,350)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\fs25\c&H596C91&\3c&HF8FFEE&\frz353.2\pos(368,22.34)}Caderno de Rascunhos
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:00.90,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,da minha irmã.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:02.90,Sign_Arial,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnComic Sans MS\frz13\shad0\c&H6A797E&\3c&HF9FFEE&\pos(330,165.33)}Caderno de Rascunhos
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:19.09,Sign_Arial,Hikaru,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\pos(500,160)\frz33\shad0\fs25\c&H475373&\3c&HD9E9CF&}Caderno de Rascunhos
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:19.09,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Não acredito…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:23.18,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ela tava desenhando!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:29.97,Sign_Arial,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\fs38\c&HD6D9D7&\pos(542,248)}continua
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:36.00,Sign_Arial,JIKAI,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\fnTimes New Roman\shad2\bord0\4c&H111113&\fs28\pos(320.67,113.33)}A Seguir\N\N\N\N\N\Nsolicitação 22.\h\h\h\h\hPássaro Errante

